WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:05,260
Xiong Xiong, there is a floor washing machine and three sweepers here, all handed over to you.

2
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,940
Thank you, host. The hotel is clean.

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:10,980
Xiongxiong, I have to trouble you to put these two massage machines in the lobby.

4
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:11,980
Just put it next to the sofa

5
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:12,980
ok master

6
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:18,880
System: It takes ten minutes to set up the massage machine and you need to pay ten cents to get it.

7
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,430
Boss Xia, the store has new goods.

8
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:24,430
Yes. How many would the guests like?

9
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:25,830
Three pants and three vests each

10
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,230
I also need two bags of washing powder.

11
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,590
Otherwise, I won’t be able to wash my clothes cleanly.

12
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:29,750
I also need three pieces of underwear.

13
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,430
Do the guests want three electric toothbrushes?

14
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,230
Not expensive, only fifty cents each

15
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:34,670
No, it's of no use

16
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,960
I can get two T-shirts.

17
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,400
A total of two hundred and sixty-eight points

18
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,200
Thank you for your purchase. Please swipe your card

19
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,240
Thanks Xia Yan

20
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,560
Go upstairs and change clothes. Come on.

21
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,080
I despise this thing about myself
